Keep an eye out for me, will you?

1282
01:55:03.470 --> 01:55:05.410
Now what, you need someone to shake it for you?

1283
01:55:05.630 --> 01:55:05.930
Hello.

1284
01:55:10.980 --> 01:55:12.280
I thought you was dead. Half.

1285
01:55:21.800 --> 01:55:23.520
Must have been Maroni's man. Shut up!

1286
01:55:25.200 --> 01:55:29.020
Are you telling me that you're going to protect the other traitor in Gordon's unit?

1287
01:55:29.420 --> 01:55:30.780
I don't know, he never told me.

1288
01:55:31.060 --> 01:55:33.640
Listen, Den, I swear to God, I didn't know what they were going to do to you.

1289
01:55:39.340 --> 01:55:40.860
I don't know what's going to happen to you either.

1290
01:55:48.470 --> 01:55:48.830
Beautiful.

1291
01:55:50.750 --> 01:55:51.110
Unethical.

1292
01:55:52.830 --> 01:55:53.190
Dangerous.

1293
01:55:54.050 --> 01:55:57.850
You've turned every cell phone in Gotham into a microphone.

1294
01:55:58.170 --> 01:56:00.290
And a high frequency generator receiver.

1295
01:56:00.830 --> 01:56:05.690
You took my sonar concept and applied it to every phone in the city.

1296
01:56:06.170 --> 01:56:09.430
With half the city feeding you sonar, you can image all of Gotham.

1297
01:56:12.590 --> 01:56:13.870
This is wrong.

1298
01:56:14.210 --> 01:56:14.390
At

1299
01:56:17.910 --> 01:56:19.210
what cost?

1300
01:56:19.570 --> 01:56:20.990
The database is no key.

1301
01:56:26.100 --> 01:56:28.020
This is too much power for one person.

1302
01:56:28.460 --> 01:56:29.580
That's why I gave it to you.

1303
01:56:32.730 --> 01:56:35.930
Spying on 30 million people isn't part of my job description.

1304
01:56:35.930 --> 01:56:36.770
If

1305
01:56:39.880 --> 01:56:41.380
he talks within range of any phone.

1306
01:56:45.000 --> 01:56:46.420
I'll help you this one time.

1307
01:56:46.640 --> 01:56:49.560
Of course. But consider this my resignation.

1308
01:56:49.980 --> 01:56:53.540
As long as this machine is at Wayne Enterprises, I won't be.

1309
01:57:07.980 --> 01:57:11.260
My officers are going over every inch of the tunnels and bridges but with the

1310
01:57:11.260 --> 01:57:12.040
Joker's threat.

1311
01:57:14.190 --> 01:57:16.410
And Landry's East? Backed up for hours.

1312
01:57:17.330 --> 01:57:20.190
Which deletes the ferries with 30,000 ready to board.

1313
01:57:21.090 --> 01:57:23.890
Plus I want to use the ferries so I can get some of those prisoners off the island.

1314
01:57:24.710 --> 01:57:27.250
The men you and Den put away? Those aren't people I'm worried about.

1315
01:57:27.250 --> 01:57:30.570
You should be. Whatever the Joker's planning, it's a good bet that Harvey's

1316
01:57:30.570 --> 01:57:33.130
prisoners might be involved. I want to get him out of here.

1317
01:57:35.690 --> 01:57:36.470
So where is Harvey?

1318
01:57:37.390 --> 01:57:38.330
We haven't found him.

1319
01:57:39.150 --> 01:57:39.550
How

1320
01:57:44.320 --> 01:57:45.520
long can he keep this quiet?

1321
01:58:00.520 --> 01:58:02.540
No stuff for lights, cops, nothing.

1322
01:58:04.020 --> 01:58:05.100
Going to join your wife?

1323
01:58:09.860 --> 01:58:10.380
You love her?

1324
01:58:11.560 --> 01:58:11.860
Yes.

1325
01:58:13.200 --> 01:58:15.380
You ever imagine what it would be like to listen to her die?

1326
01:58:15.960 --> 01:58:17.020
Look, take it up with the Joker.

1327
01:58:17.840 --> 01:58:18.600
He killed you.

1328
01:58:19.480 --> 01:58:20.360
He made you.

1329
01:58:22.560 --> 01:58:24.360
The Joker's just a mad dog.

1330
01:58:26.020 --> 01:58:27.420
I want whoever let him off the leash.

1331
01:58:29.380 --> 01:58:32.540
I took care of words. But who's your other man inside Gordon's unit?

1332
01:58:32.680 --> 01:58:34.960
Who picked up Rachel? Must have been someone she trusted.

1333
01:58:36.700 --> 01:58:38.140
Look, if I tell you...

1334
01:58:52.190 --> 01:58:53.890
I said it couldn't hurt your chances.

1335
01:59:05.460 --> 01:59:05.720
Who?

1336
01:59:08.930 --> 01:59:09.650
Your driver.

1337
01:59:10.910 --> 01:59:11.090
Get

1338
01:59:26.450 --> 01:59:28.290
on that boat! You wanna ride across with them?

1339
01:59:28.450 --> 01:59:29.010
Be my guest.

1340
01:59:53.120 --> 01:59:56.120
Sir, they've stopped their engines. Right, get on the radio.

1341
01:59:56.280 --> 01:59:59.180
Tell them we'll come back and pick them up once we dump the scumbags.

1342
02:00:00.140 --> 02:00:01.300
Liberty, this is Spirit. Come in.

1343
02:00:05.030 --> 02:00:05.150
that?

1344
02:00:08.930 --> 02:00:09.370
On

1345
02:00:18.780 --> 02:00:19.500
the ferries.

1346
02:00:21.600 --> 02:00:23.160
Get down to the engine room now.

1347
02:00:25.080 --> 02:00:25.560
We've

1348
02:00:35.480 --> 02:00:39.080
got a hundred barrels down there rigged to blow in this kind

1349
02:00:53.930 --> 02:00:57.390
of detonator. Why would they give us the detonator to our own bomb?

1350
02:01:00.870 --> 02:01:03.550
Tonight you're all going to be a part of a social experiment.

1351
02:01:07.950 --> 02:01:11.330
I rule the magic of diesel fuel or ammonium nitrate.

1352
02:01:11.930 --> 02:01:15.030
I'm ready right now to blow you all sky high.

1353
02:01:16.050 --> 02:01:17.070
Liberty, come in. Over.

1354
02:01:20.020 --> 02:01:23.160
It's dead. Anyone attempts to get off their boat,

1355
02:01:24.040 --> 02:01:25.000
you all die.

1356
02:01:26.740 --> 02:01:31.780
Each of you has a remote to blow up the other boat.

1357
02:01:32.520 --> 02:01:36.240
The force is on the ferry, but it's not the source.

1358
02:01:38.980 --> 02:01:39.380
West.

1359
02:01:47.440 --> 02:01:49.020
Gordon. I have the Joker's location.

1360
02:01:49.980 --> 02:01:52.300
Pruitt building. Assemble on the building opposite.

1361
02:01:54.900 --> 02:01:57.560
At midnight, I blow you all up.

1362
02:01:58.160 --> 02:02:02.340
If, however, one of you presses the button, I'll let that boat live.

1363
02:02:03.300 --> 02:02:04.940
So, who's it gonna be?

1364
02:02:05.660 --> 02:02:10.880
Harvey Dent's most wanted scumbag collection or the sweet and innocent civilians?

1365
02:02:11.960 --> 02:02:12.960
You choose.

1366
02:02:14.140 --> 02:02:14.360
Oh,

1367
02:02:15.200 --> 02:02:19.560
and you might want to decide quickly because the people on the other boat may not be

1368
02:02:19.560 --> 02:02:21.060
quite so noble.

1369
02:02:28.300 --> 02:02:30.700
Stay back. Well, now, who are you to decide?

1370
02:02:31.420 --> 02:02:33.240
We ought to talk this over at least.

1371
02:02:33.500 --> 02:02:34.940
We don't all have to die.

1372
02:02:35.220 --> 02:02:36.760
Those men had their chance.

1373
02:02:37.840 --> 02:02:39.960
We are not going to talk about this.

1374
02:02:40.180 --> 02:02:41.620
Why aren't we talking about it?

1375
02:02:41.860 --> 02:02:44.500
We're talking over the same exact thing on the other boat.

1376
02:02:44.620 --> 02:02:45.500
Let's put it to a vote.

1377
02:02:53.270 --> 02:02:57.990
It's Anna Ramirez. Jim needs you to pack up and put the kids in the car right away.

1378
02:02:58.410 --> 02:02:59.650
But the unit's outside.

1379
02:03:00.070 --> 02:03:01.490
Those cops can't be trusted.

1380
02:03:01.830 --> 02:03:04.370
Jim needs you away from them as soon as possible.

1381
02:03:05.010 --> 02:03:07.950
I'll call them off for ten minutes, and you'll have to move fast.

1382
02:03:08.150 --> 02:03:09.690
But where am I supposed to take them?

1383
02:03:10.790 --> 02:03:13.830
250 52nd Street. Leave as soon as the patrol car pulls out.

1384
02:03:14.210 --> 02:03:14.390
Okay.

1385
02:03:15.830 --> 02:03:16.530
Jim, believe you.

1386
02:03:17.830 --> 02:03:19.050
It's cause she trusts you.

1387
02:03:20.090 --> 02:03:23.250
Just like Rachel did. I didn't know what they were gonna do.

1388
02:03:23.250 --> 02:03:25.390
You're the second cop to say that to me.

1389
02:03:26.750 --> 02:03:28.870
What exactly did you think they were gonna do?

1390
02:03:28.990 --> 02:03:31.950
They got me early on. My mother's hospital bills and- Don't!

1391
02:03:34.880 --> 02:03:36.660
Live to fight another day, officer.

1392
02:03:41.440 --> 02:03:42.760
We found the missing hospital bus.

1393
02:03:42.960 --> 02:03:44.360
Then we have a hostage situation.

1394
02:03:47.050 --> 02:03:47.770
It's a shooting.

1395
02:03:49.540 --> 02:03:51.400
Why would he choose a spot with such big windows?

1396
02:03:51.900 --> 02:03:53.760
We have clear shots on five clowns.

1397
02:03:53.920 --> 02:03:56.860
Snipers take them out, smash the windows, a team repels in.

1398
02:03:57.340 --> 02:03:58.920
Team moves in by the stairwells.

1399
02:03:58.980 --> 02:04:00.220
Two, three casualties max.

1400
02:04:00.880 --> 02:04:02.780
Let's do it. It's not that simple.

1401
02:04:02.800 --> 02:04:04.340
With a joker, it never is.

1402
02:04:04.680 --> 02:04:07.680
What's simple is that every second we don't take him, those people on the ferries

1403
02:04:07.680 --> 02:04:09.140
get closer to blowing each other up.

1404
02:04:09.140 --> 02:04:11.580
That won't happen. Then he'll blow both of them up.

1405
02:04:11.740 --> 02:04:16.280
We don't have time for paper. I want everybody to put their votes on this piece of

1406
02:04:16.280 --> 02:04:16.520
paper.

1407
02:04:18.740 --> 02:04:21.620
If anyone's got pens, pass it along.

1408
02:04:25.860 --> 02:04:27.840
We need to get these folks seen quickly.

1409
02:04:28.980 --> 02:04:29.200
Come on.

1410
02:04:34.220 --> 02:04:34.780
I

1411
02:04:37.590 --> 02:04:39.650
need five minutes alone.

1412
02:04:39.930 --> 02:04:41.510
No, there's no time.

1413
02:04:41.650 --> 02:04:43.310
We have clear shots.

1414
02:04:43.610 --> 02:04:45.890
Dent is in there with them. We have to save Dent.

1415
02:04:46.490 --> 02:04:48.150
I have to save Dent.

1416
02:04:48.810 --> 02:04:49.230
Get ready.

1417
02:04:52.600 --> 02:04:53.160
Two minutes.

1418
02:05:09.560 --> 02:05:11.280
Hey, you got POV on Alpha.

1419
02:05:12.660 --> 02:05:13.260
I'm the own beta.

1420
02:05:15.920 --> 02:05:18.140
It's like clowns and hostages on two floors.

1421
02:05:19.420 --> 02:05:20.960
The SWAT team on the stairwell.

1422
02:05:25.270 --> 02:05:26.770
Another SWAT team on the stairwell. SWAT team on the roof.

1423
02:05:32.460 --> 02:05:34.340
Barber, calm down. He has the kids.

1424
02:05:35.240 --> 02:05:35.860
Hello, Jim.

1425
02:05:38.420 --> 02:05:40.080
Harvey, where's my family?

1426
02:05:40.520 --> 02:05:42.020
Where my family died.

1427
02:05:46.420 --> 02:05:47.160
Acquire the target.

1428
02:05:49.700 --> 02:05:50.360
Set your charge.

1429
02:07:33.230 --> 02:07:35.910
30-40 against, 396-4.

1430
02:07:47.150 --> 02:07:48.170
We're still here.

1431
02:07:50.440 --> 02:07:52.540
That means they haven't killed us yet either.

1432
02:08:03.710 --> 02:08:05.110
Something on the floor above.

1433
02:08:33.780 --> 02:08:35.520
We got him. He's out of the game.

1434
02:09:14.740 --> 02:09:16.100
I'm so thrilled. We're still here.

1435
02:10:22.450 --> 02:10:23.630
Everyone wants to get their hands dirty.

1436
02:10:24.710 --> 02:10:25.150
Fine.

1437
02:10:26.010 --> 02:10:26.790
I'll do it.

1438
02:10:29.580 --> 02:10:31.620
Those men on that boat? They made their choices.

1439
02:10:32.440 --> 02:10:34.320
They chose to murder and steal.

1440
02:10:34.820 --> 02:10:37.040
To make any sense for us to have to die too.

1441
02:10:47.310 --> 02:10:48.650
Call the old familiar places.

1442
02:11:47.060 --> 02:11:49.340
Stop this fighting. Otherwise we'll miss the fireworks.

1443
02:11:49.740 --> 02:11:51.380
There won't be any fireworks.

1444
02:11:52.280 --> 02:11:54.120
And here we go.

1445
02:12:59.680 --> 02:13:01.200
You know how I got these scars?

1446
02:13:01.800 --> 02:13:04.340
No. But I know how you got these!

1447
02:13:06.640 --> 02:13:08.170
You just

1448
02:13:26.150 --> 02:13:28.730
couldn't let me go, could you?

1449
02:13:29.490 --> 02:13:34.770
This is what happens when an unstoppable force meets an

1450
02:13:34.770 --> 02:13:36.490
immovable object.

1451
02:13:38.670 --> 02:13:43.370
You truly are incorruptible, aren't you?

1452
02:13:44.330 --> 02:13:49.750
Huh? You won't kill me out of some misplaced sense

1453
02:13:49.750 --> 02:13:52.590
of self-righteousness.

1454
02:13:53.410 --> 02:13:59.370
And I won't kill you because you're just too much fun.

1455
02:14:01.360 --> 02:14:05.380
I think you and I are destined to do this forever.

1456
02:14:06.360 --> 02:14:07.860
You'll be in a better jail forever.

1457
02:14:08.280 --> 02:14:09.460
Maybe we could share one.

1458
02:14:10.260 --> 02:14:13.740
You know, they'll be doubling up the rate this city's inhabitants are losing their

1459
02:14:13.740 --> 02:14:19.340
minds. This city just showed you that it's full of people

1460
02:14:19.340 --> 02:14:21.740
ready to believe in good.

1461
02:14:21.740 --> 02:14:24.800
Until their spirit breaks completely.

1462
02:14:26.060 --> 02:14:29.660
Until they get a good look at the real Harvey Dent.

1463
02:14:30.480 --> 02:14:33.400
And all the heroic things he's done.

1464
02:14:35.080 --> 02:14:41.000
You didn't think I'd risk losing the battle for Gotham's soul in

1465
02:14:41.000 --> 02:14:42.320
a fistfight with you.

1466
02:14:45.940 --> 02:14:48.640
You need an ace in the hole.

1467
02:14:49.660 --> 02:14:50.820
Mine's Harvey.

1468
02:14:51.660 --> 02:14:52.500
What did you do?

1469
02:14:53.400 --> 02:14:59.360
I took Gotham's white knight and I brought him down to our

1470
02:14:59.360 --> 02:14:59.920
level.

1471
02:15:00.780 --> 02:15:05.960
It wasn't hard. See, madness, as you know, is like gravity.

1472
02:15:06.920 --> 02:15:09.320
All it takes is a little push.

1473
02:15:16.320 --> 02:15:17.520
This is

1474
02:15:49.320 --> 02:15:50.220
where they brought her, Gordon.

1475
02:15:51.160 --> 02:15:52.440
After your men handed her over.

1476
02:15:55.700 --> 02:15:58.060
I know I was here trying

1477
02:15:59.540 --> 02:16:01.460
to save her. But you didn't.

1478
02:16:01.960 --> 02:16:04.080
I couldn't. Yes, you could've.

1479
02:16:04.200 --> 02:16:09.360
If you'd have listened to me. If you stood up against corruption instead of doing

1480
02:16:09.360 --> 02:16:10.580
your deal with the devil.

1481
02:16:10.880 --> 02:16:12.460
I was trying to fight the mob!

1482
02:16:13.120 --> 02:16:16.580
You wouldn't dare try to justify yourself if you knew what I'd lost.

1483
02:16:19.340 --> 02:16:22.060
Have you ever had to talk to the person you love most?

1484
02:16:22.660 --> 02:16:25.160
Tell them it's gonna be alright when you know it's not?

1485
02:16:29.760 --> 02:16:31.820
You're about to know what that feels like, Gordon.

1486
02:16:32.860 --> 02:16:36.300
Then you can look me in the eye and tell me you're sorry.

1487
02:16:38.320 --> 02:16:40.020
You're not going to hurt my family.

1488
02:16:42.080 --> 02:16:43.580
Just the person you love most?

1489
02:16:54.040 --> 02:16:54.520
Your wife?

1490
02:16:57.040 --> 02:16:57.700
Put the gun down.

1491
02:16:58.880 --> 02:17:00.140
Harvey, put down the gun.

1492
02:17:00.960 --> 02:17:02.520
No. Please, Harvey.

1493
02:17:03.480 --> 02:17:03.960
Please.

1494
02:17:06.690 --> 02:17:08.990
Damn it, will you stop pointing that gun at my family?

1495
02:17:11.800 --> 02:17:13.280
Don't you stop it.

1496
02:17:13.740 --> 02:17:15.480
Harvey. Don't let it fall.

1497
02:17:15.480 --> 02:17:16.080
Harvey.

1498
02:17:18.000 --> 02:17:18.900
I'm sorry.

1499
02:17:22.440 --> 02:17:22.720
Everything.

1500
02:17:38.680 --> 02:17:41.180
Cops. All they know is there's a situation.

1501
02:17:42.280 --> 02:17:43.840
They don't know who or what.

1502
02:17:44.140 --> 02:17:45.460
They're just creating a perimeter.

1503
02:17:45.920 --> 02:17:47.700
You think I want to escape from this?

1504
02:17:48.640 --> 02:17:50.920
There is no escape from this.

1505
02:17:51.640 --> 02:17:53.220
You don't want to hurt the boy, Harvey.

1506
02:17:55.790 --> 02:17:57.310
It's not about what I want.

1507
02:17:57.490 --> 02:17:58.690
It's about what's fair!

1508
02:17:59.710 --> 02:18:03.690
You thought we could be decent men in an indecent time.

1509
02:18:08.880 --> 02:18:14.100
The world is cruel. And the only morality in a cruel world is chance.

1510
02:18:15.660 --> 02:18:16.180
Unbiased.

1511
02:18:17.600 --> 02:18:18.180
Unprejudiced.

1512
02:18:21.320 --> 02:18:23.270
His son's got the same chance she had.

1513
02:18:24.560 --> 02:18:27.260
Fifty-fifty. What happened to Rachel was a chance.

1514
02:18:27.980 --> 02:18:30.160
We decided to act. We three.

1515
02:18:31.140 --> 02:18:34.260
Then why was it me who was the only one who lost everything?

1516
02:18:37.900 --> 02:18:39.360
The Joker chose me.

1517
02:18:39.700 --> 02:18:41.760
Because you were the best of us.

1518
02:18:41.760 --> 02:18:47.620
He wanted to prove that even someone as good as you could

1519
02:18:47.620 --> 02:18:48.040
fall.

1520
02:18:49.620 --> 02:18:52.260
And he was right. You're the one pointing the gun, Harvey.

1521
02:18:53.500 --> 02:18:56.280
So point it at the people responsible.

1522
02:19:25.700 --> 02:19:26.400
Harvey, you're right.

1523
02:19:28.720 --> 02:19:29.720
Rachel's death was my

1524
02:19:34.100 --> 02:19:35.460
fling. Please don't punish the boy.

1525
02:19:38.320 --> 02:19:38.660
Punish me.

1526
02:19:42.970 --> 02:19:44.490
Tell your boy it's gonna be alright, Gordon.

1527
02:19:45.510 --> 02:19:45.770
Lie.

1528
02:19:47.290 --> 02:19:48.230
Like I lied.

1529
02:21:05.650 --> 02:21:06.510
Anything you fall for,

1530
02:21:07.890 --> 02:21:08.390
I'm done.

1531
02:21:10.130 --> 02:21:14.330
Whatever chance you give us of fixing our city, dies with Harvey's reputation.

1532
02:21:15.190 --> 02:21:16.250
We bet it all on him.

1533
02:21:21.230 --> 02:21:22.110
People will lose hope.

1534
02:21:29.120 --> 02:21:29.560
Five dead,

1535
02:21:31.180 --> 02:21:34.120
two of them cops. You can't sweep that off.

1536
02:22:17.720 --> 02:22:18.980
You are not a

1537
02:22:27.330 --> 02:22:27.930
hero,

1538
02:22:29.290 --> 02:22:32.430
